<title>UK: T&amp;N sells Flexitallic to Dan Loc Corp.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N sells Flexitallic to Dan Loc Corp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British automotive components and engineering group T&amp;N Plc said on Monday it had sold its Flexitallic industrial sealing businesses for 42 million stg to U.S. group Dan Loc Corporation.</p>
<p>T&amp;N said the proceeds from the sale would be put into its fund for future asbestos-related disease claims.</p>
<p>Flexitallic, which employs approximately 700 people in Britain, the U.S., Canada, Germany and the Czech Republic, manufactures gaskets for industrial pipelines.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
